Package: nanolx-base
Architecture: all
Depends:
 nanolx-apt-tools,
 nanolx-apt-sources,
 systemd,
 libnotify-bin,
 rsync,
 bash-completion
Recommends:
 appimagelauncher
Description: Nanolx base package
 Nanolx is a set of meta-packages, wich I use to aid in syncing the package
 selection between my machine and machines that are maintained by me.
 .
 nanolx-base is the minimal set

